[+ sc_display +] will engage in the primordially primal practice of violence, aimed at the **<span style="color:rgb(255, 208, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Gold Trigon</span>**.

</div>

- @menu: Return

