- @menu: Return

@target_chosen
on-arrival: {! 

Q[Q.selected_combatant+"_target"] = Q.selected_target;
if (Q.consumes_turns) {
    Q[Q.selected_target+"_action"] = "immobile";
    Q.consumes_turns = 0;
}
Q.selected_combatant = 0;
Q.selected_target = 0;
Q.choosing_target = 0;

!}

<div class="combat-advisor-screen">

Our sights have been set upon the target, upon which our comraderly affections shall be bestowed.

</div>

- @menu: Return

@finalize_plan
view-if: planning_combat and plan_is_done
on-arrival: planning_combat = 0

<div class="combat-advisor-screen">

We have finalized the battle plan, so it may be implemented next turn.

</div>

- @menu: Return

@next_turn
view-if: everyone_is_done and not planning_combat
on-arrival: everyone_is_done = 0; {! 

Q.gold_trigon_turn += 1;

for (var c of Q.combatants) {
    Q[c+"_action"] = "";
    // later obv do stuff with the actions before clearing them to resolve turn, for now want to get down the stuff that would have to be cleared
}

if (Q.gold_trigon_turn == 2) {
    window.showCombatDialogue("doraemon", "Okay, wow. You're all still alive. That's good to see.");
}

!} 

<div class="combat-advisor-screen">

We attack the Gold Trigon.

</div>

- @menu: Return
